# bl-ui-scale (the operator, 2026-10-21): "revealed top of the deck area should be slightly larger than the
# graveyard area" and "add a slider to allow scaling the size of the UI". Alice has Courser of Kruphix (her
# library's top card drawn on both screens) and a graveyard, bob a graveyard, at her own main phase.
# Exploration gives her two land drops: one Forest played from her hand by a click at each end of the scale.
# Divination keeps the main phase a real stop.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=Forest;Forest;Divination
humanbattlefield=Forest;Forest;Forest;Island;Courser of Kruphix;Exploration
humanlibrary=Serra Angel;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp
humangraveyard=Lightning Bolt;Shock;Giant Growth
aihand=
aibattlefield=Island
ailibrary=Llanowar Elves;Grizzly Bears;Savannah Lions;Giant Growth;Dark Ritual;Counterspell
aigraveyard=Counterspell;Dark Ritual
